Abhängigkeiten installieren
===========================
pip install -r requirements.txt

Streamlit App starten
=====================
streamlit run app.py

Requirements (requirements.txt)
===============================
streamlit
astropy
sunpy[map]
reproject
mpl-animators
opencv-python-headless
matplotlib
numpy
pywavelets
requests
scikit-image
scikit-learn
timezonefinder
